ComfyUI Ideogram4 DirectJSON Modified

This repository is a modified derivative of the Ideogram 4 prompt builder from
ComfyUI-KJNodes.

Original project:
https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes

Original copyright belongs to the ComfyUI-KJNodes authors and contributors.

This modified standalone package keeps the original GNU GPL v3 license and marks
the changed behavior:

- unique plugin package name
- unique node id: Ideogram4DirectJSONBuilderModified
- unique frontend extension name: WorkFisher.Ideogram4DirectJSONModified
- import_json can be used as a one-run backend source when the visual editor is empty
- manually edited visual boxes serialize back into the output JSON

